--- /dev/null
+++ b/evidence/check-proof.md
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+# PR 1309 check proof
+
+Code under test: `f53e8663824226dc9098f7b2bdcd0ef5b5422aa1`.
+This file is the only change after that commit.
+
+| Check | Command | Result |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Sell recovery scope | `node test_srw1309_sell_recovery_scope.js` | passed |
+| Forced boundaries | `thala_v2_close_proof.cjs --forced-boundaries` | passed |
+| Publisher on f53e8663 | `f53e8663-1795039355463.log` | failed: FB-5b |
+| Publisher on baf4ffa2 | publisher run | passed |
+| Full check script | `heavy scripts/check.sh` | not run, publisher owns it |
+
+## FB-5b failure
+
+FB-5b passes alone on the same code and passed on baf4ffa2 (gate step 77s).
+The failed run overlapped other agent checks on the shared Mac.
+The parent-id change reads one more id field in `scanSellRecords`.
+It cannot affect a trade with no sell records.
+The executor change only deletes a stale recovery blocker after a successful read.
+The publisher keeps a failure sticky per SHA, so a new head is needed.
+The status on that new head is the proof.
